### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get All Todos (Default list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get All Todos with Filters (Status & Priority)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos?status=PENDING&priority=HIGH
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Todos by Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos?search=flight
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a New Todo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Corporate Travel Policy Audit",
  "description": "Review and update enterprise travel expense allowances for Q4",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "category": "Compliance",
  "due_date": "2026-10-20"
}

### 6. Get Single Todo by ID (Replace with valid ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update an Existing Todo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Corporate Travel Policy Audit (Revised)",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 8. Toggle Completion Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1/toggle
Accept: application/json

### 9. Delete a Todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json
